# Forces browsers and Cloudflare's edge to always re-check for a fresh copy
# instead of silently serving a stale cached page. Without this, a deployed
# fix (like the port-questionnaire.html update on 5 Aug 2026) can keep being
# served in its old form for a while after going live — which is exactly
# what happened with the Muuga Sadam submission going out through the old
# FormSubmit path even though the fixed file was already deployed.
#
# Same pattern already in use for app.imwirsa.org (MWApp) — this extends it
# to the main site.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate
